                "text": "CVE-2020-25638: Improper Neutralization of Special Elements used in an SQL Command ('SQL Injection')"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://scout.docker.com/v/CVE-2020-25638?s=github&n=hibernate-core&ns=org.hibernate&t=maven&vr=%3C5.3.20.Final",
              "help": {
                "text": "A flaw was found in hibernate-core in versions prior to 5.3.20.Final and in 5.4.0.Final up to and including 5.4.23.Final. A SQL injection in the implementation of the JPA Criteria API can permit unsanitized literals when a literal is used in the SQL comments of the query. This flaw could allow an attacker to access unauthorized information or possibly conduct further attacks. The highest threat from this vulnerability is to data confidentiality and integrity.\n",
                "markdown": "> A flaw was found in hibernate-core in versions prior to 5.3.20.Final and in 5.4.0.Final up to and including 5.4.23.Final. A SQL injection in the implementation of the JPA Criteria API can permit unsanitized literals when a literal is used in the SQL comments of the query. This flaw could allow an attacker to access unauthorized information or possibly conduct further attacks. The highest threat from this vulnerability is to data confidentiality and integrity.\n\n|                                                                                                                                    |\n|Package                                                                        pkg:maven/org.hibernate/hibernate-core@3.6.10.Final  |\n|Affected range                                                                 <5.3.20.Final                                        |\n|Fixed version                                                                  5.3.20.Final                                         |\n|[[CVSS Score 7.4] [CVSS Vector CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:H/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:N]]                                                       |\n"
